\c 7
\s1 Job Continues: Life Seems Futile
\q1 \v 1 “\w Is not|strong="H03808"\w* \w man|strong="H00582"\w* \w consigned to labor|strong="H06635"\w* \w on|strong="H05921"\w* \w earth|strong="H00776"\w*?
