\q2 \w like a hireling|strong="H07916"\w* \w he waits for|strong="H06960"\w* \w his wages|strong="H06467"\w*.
\q1 \v 3 \w So|strong="H03651"\w* \w I am allotted|strong="H05157"\w* \w months|strong="H03391"\w* \w of futility|strong="H07723"\w*,
\q2 \w and nights|strong="H03915"\w* \w of misery|strong="H05999"\w* \w are appointed|strong="H04487"\w* to me.
\q1 \v 4 \w When|strong="H00518"\w* \w I lie down|strong="H07901"\w* \w I think|strong="H00559"\w*:
\q2 ‘\w When|strong="H04970"\w* \w will I get up|strong="H06965"\w*?’
\q1 \w But the night|strong="H06153"\w* \w drags on|strong="H04058"\w*,
