\c 8
\s1 Bildad: Job Should Repent
\p \v 1 \w Then Bildad|strong="H01085"\w* \w the Shuhite|strong="H07747"\w* \w replied|strong="H06030"\w*:
\b 
\q1 \v 2 “\w How long|strong="H05704"\w* \w will you go on saying|strong="H04448"\w* \w such things|strong="H00428"\w*?
\q2 \w The words|strong="H00561"\w* \w of your mouth|strong="H06310"\w* \w are a blustering|strong="H03524"\w* \w wind|strong="H07307"\w*.
\q1 \v 3 \w Does God|strong="H00410"\w* \w pervert|strong="H05791"\w* \w justice|strong="H04941"\w*?
\q2 \w Does the Almighty|strong="H07706"\w* \w pervert|strong="H05791"\w* \w what is right|strong="H06664"\w*?
\q1 \v 4 \w When|strong="H00518"\w* \w your children|strong="H01121"\w* \w sinned|strong="H02398"\w* against Him,
\q2 \w He gave them over|strong="H07971"\w* \w to their rebellion|strong="H06588"\w*.
\q1 \v 5 \w But if|strong="H00518"\w* \w you|strong="H00859"\w* \w would earnestly seek|strong="H07836"\w* \w God|strong="H00410"\w*
\q2 \w and ask the Almighty|strong="H07706"\w* \w for mercy|strong="H02603"\w*,
