\q2 \w and the tent|strong="H00168"\w* \w of the wicked|strong="H07563"\w* \w will be no more|strong="H00369"\w*.”
\c 9
\s1 Job: How Can I Contend with God?
\p \v 1 \w Then Job|strong="H00347"\w* \w answered|strong="H06030"\w*:
\b 
\q1 \v 2 “\w Yes|strong="H00551"\w*, \w I know|strong="H03045"\w* \w that|strong="H03588"\w* \w it is so|strong="H03651"\w*,
\q2 \w but how|strong="H04100"\w* \w can a mortal|strong="H00582"\w* \w be righteous|strong="H06663"\w* \w before|strong="H05973"\w* \w God|strong="H00410"\w*?
\q1 \v 3 \w If|strong="H00518"\w* \w one wished|strong="H02654"\w* \w to contend|strong="H07378"\w* \w with God|strong="H05973"\w*,\f + \fr 9:3 \ft Or \fqa If God wished to contend with someone\f*
\q2 \w he could not|strong="H03808"\w* \w answer Him|strong="H06030"\w* \w one time|strong="H00259"\w* \w out of|strong="H04480"\w* \w a thousand|strong="H00505"\w*.
\q1 \v 4 \w God is wise|strong="H02450"\w* \w in heart|strong="H03824"\w* \w and mighty|strong="H00533"\w* \w in strength|strong="H03581"\w*.
\q2 \w Who|strong="H04310"\w* \w has resisted|strong="H07185"\w* \w Him|strong="H00413"\w* \w and prospered|strong="H07999"\w*?
\q1 \v 5 \w He moves|strong="H06275"\w* \w mountains|strong="H02022"\w* \w without|strong="H03808"\w* \w their knowledge|strong="H03045"\w*
\q2 \w and|strong="H00834"\w* \w overturns them|strong="H02015"\w* \w in His anger|strong="H00639"\w*.
\q1 \v 6 \w He shakes|strong="H07264"\w* \w the earth|strong="H00776"\w* \w from its place|strong="H04725"\w*,
\q2 \w so that its foundations|strong="H05982"\w* \w tremble|strong="H06426"\w*.
\q1 \v 7 \w He commands|strong="H00559"\w* \w the sun|strong="H02775"\w* \w not|strong="H03808"\w* \w to shine|strong="H02224"\w*;\f + \fr 9:7 \ft Or \fqa rise\f*
\q2 \w He seals off|strong="H01157"\w* \w the stars|strong="H03556"\w*.
\q1 \v 8 \w He alone|strong="H00905"\w* \w stretches out|strong="H05186"\w* \w the heavens|strong="H08064"\w*
\q2 \w and treads|strong="H01869"\w* \w on|strong="H05921"\w* \w the waves|strong="H01116"\w* \w of the sea|strong="H03220"\w*.
\q1 \v 9 \w He is the Maker|strong="H06213"\w* \w of the Bear|strong="H05906"\w* \w and Orion|strong="H03685"\w*,
\q2 \w of the Pleiades|strong="H03598"\w* \w and the constellations|strong="H02315"\w* \w of the south|strong="H08486"\w*.
\q1 \v 10 \w He does|strong="H06213"\w* \w great things|strong="H01419"\w* \w beyond|strong="H05704"\w* \w searching out|strong="H02714"\w*,
\q2 \w and wonders|strong="H06381"\w* \w without|strong="H00369"\w* \w number|strong="H04557"\w*.
\q1 \v 11 \w Were He|strong="H02005"\w* \w to pass|strong="H05674"\w* \w by me|strong="H05921"\w*, \w I would not|strong="H03808"\w* \w see Him|strong="H07200"\w*;
\q2 \w were He to move|strong="H02498"\w*, \w I would not|strong="H03808"\w* \w recognize|strong="H00995"\w* Him.
\q1 \v 12 \w If|strong="H02005"\w* \w He takes away|strong="H02862"\w*,\f + \fr 9:12 \ft Or \fqa snatches someone in death\f* \w who|strong="H04310"\w* \w can stop Him|strong="H07725"\w*?
\q2 \w Who|strong="H04310"\w* \w dares to ask|strong="H00559"\w* \w Him|strong="H00413"\w*, ‘\w What|strong="H04100"\w* \w are You doing|strong="H06213"\w*?’
\q1 \v 13 \w God|strong="H00433"\w* \w does not|strong="H03808"\w* \w restrain|strong="H07725"\w* \w His anger|strong="H00639"\w*;
\q2 \w the helpers|strong="H05826"\w* \w of Rahab|strong="H07294"\w* \w cower|strong="H07817"\w* \w beneath Him|strong="H08478"\w*.
\b 
\q1 \v 14 \w How|strong="H00637"\w* \w then|strong="H03588"\w* \w can I|strong="H00595"\w* \w answer Him|strong="H06030"\w*
\q2 \w or choose|strong="H00977"\w* \w my arguments|strong="H01697"\w* \w against Him|strong="H05973"\w*?
\q1 \v 15 \w For|strong="H00834"\w* \w even if|strong="H00518"\w* \w I were right|strong="H06663"\w*, \w I could not|strong="H03808"\w* \w answer|strong="H06030"\w*.
\q2 \w I could only beg my Judge|strong="H08199"\w* \w for mercy|strong="H02603"\w*.
\q1 \v 16 \w If|strong="H00518"\w* \w I summoned Him|strong="H07121"\w* \w and He answered me|strong="H06030"\w*,
\q2 \w I do not|strong="H03808"\w* \w believe|strong="H00539"\w* \w He would listen|strong="H00238"\w* \w to my voice|strong="H06963"\w*.
\q1 \v 17 \w For|strong="H00834"\w* \w He would crush me|strong="H07779"\w* \w with a tempest|strong="H08183"\w*
\q2 \w and multiply|strong="H07235"\w* \w my wounds|strong="H06482"\w* \w without cause|strong="H02600"\w*.
\q1 \v 18 \w He does not|strong="H03808"\w* \w let me|strong="H05414"\w* \w catch|strong="H07725"\w* \w my breath|strong="H07307"\w*,
\q2 \w but|strong="H03588"\w* \w overwhelms me|strong="H07646"\w* \w with bitterness|strong="H04472"\w*.
\q1 \v 19 \w If|strong="H00518"\w* \w it is a matter of strength|strong="H03581"\w*,
\q2 \w He is indeed|strong="H02009"\w* \w mighty|strong="H00533"\w*!
\q1 \w If|strong="H00518"\w* \w it is a matter of justice|strong="H04941"\w*,
\q2 \w who|strong="H04310"\w* \w can summon Him|strong="H03259"\w*\f + \fr 9:19 \ft See LXX; Hebrew \fqa me\f*?
\q1 \v 20 \w Even if|strong="H00518"\w* \w I were righteous|strong="H06663"\w*, \w my mouth|strong="H06310"\w* \w would condemn me|strong="H07561"\w*;
\q2 \w if I|strong="H00589"\w* \w were blameless|strong="H08535"\w*, \w it would declare me guilty|strong="H06140"\w*.\f + \fr 9:20 \ft Or \fqa He would declare me guilty\f*
\b 
\q1 \v 21 \w Though I|strong="H00589"\w* \w am blameless|strong="H08535"\w*, \w I have no|strong="H03808"\w* \w concern|strong="H03045"\w* \w for myself|strong="H05315"\w*;
\q2 \w I despise|strong="H03988"\w* \w my own life|strong="H02416"\w*.
\q1 \v 22 \w It|strong="H01931"\w* \w is all the same|strong="H00259"\w*, \w and so|strong="H05921"\w* \w I say|strong="H00559"\w*,
\q2 ‘\w He|strong="H01931"\w* \w destroys|strong="H03615"\w* \w both the blameless|strong="H08535"\w* \w and the wicked|strong="H07563"\w*.’
\q1 \v 23 \w When|strong="H00518"\w* \w the scourge|strong="H07752"\w* \w brings sudden|strong="H06597"\w* \w death|strong="H04191"\w*,
\q2 \w He mocks|strong="H03932"\w* \w the despair|strong="H04531"\w* \w of the innocent|strong="H05355"\w*.
\q1 \v 24 \w The earth|strong="H00776"\w* \w is given|strong="H05414"\w* \w into the hand|strong="H03027"\w* \w of the wicked|strong="H07563"\w*;
\q2 \w He blindfolds|strong="H06440"\w* \w its judges|strong="H08199"\w*.
\q2 \w If|strong="H00518"\w* \w it is not He|strong="H03808"\w*, \w then|strong="H00645"\w* \w who|strong="H04310"\w* \w is it|strong="H01931"\w*?
\b 
\q1 \v 25 \w My days|strong="H03117"\w* \w are swifter|strong="H07043"\w* \w than|strong="H04480"\w* \w a runner|strong="H07323"\w*;
\q2 \w they flee|strong="H01272"\w* \w without|strong="H03808"\w* \w seeing|strong="H07200"\w* \w good|strong="H02896"\w*.
\q1 \v 26 \w They sweep by|strong="H02498"\w* \w like|strong="H05973"\w* \w boats|strong="H00591"\w* \w of papyrus|strong="H00016"\w*,
\q2 \w like an eagle|strong="H05404"\w* \w swooping down|strong="H02907"\w* \w on|strong="H05921"\w* \w its prey|strong="H00400"\w*.
\q1 \v 27 \w If|strong="H00518"\w* \w I were to say|strong="H00559"\w*, ‘\w I will forget|strong="H07911"\w* \w my complaint|strong="H07879"\w*
\q2 \w and change|strong="H05800"\w* \w my expression|strong="H06440"\w* \w and smile|strong="H01082"\w*,’
\q1 \v 28 \w I would still dread|strong="H03025"\w* \w all|strong="H03605"\w* \w my sufferings|strong="H06094"\w*;
\q2 \w I know|strong="H03045"\w* \w that|strong="H03588"\w* \w You will not|strong="H03808"\w* \w acquit me|strong="H05352"\w*.
\q1 \v 29 \w Since I am|strong="H00595"\w* \w already found guilty|strong="H07561"\w*,
\q2 \w why|strong="H04100"\w* \w should I labor|strong="H03021"\w* \w in vain|strong="H01892"\w*?
\q1 \v 30 \w If|strong="H00518"\w* \w I should wash|strong="H07364"\w* \w myself|strong="H01119"\w* \w with snow|strong="H07950"\w*\f + \fr 9:30 \ft Or \fqa soap\f*
\q2 \w and cleanse|strong="H02141"\w* \w my hands|strong="H03709"\w* \w with lye|strong="H01253"\w*,
\q1 \v 31 \w then|strong="H00227"\w* \w You would plunge me|strong="H02881"\w* \w into the pit|strong="H07845"\w*,
\q2 \w and even my own clothes|strong="H08008"\w* \w would despise me|strong="H08581"\w*.
\b 
\q1 \v 32 \w For|strong="H03588"\w* \w He is not|strong="H03808"\w* \w a man|strong="H00376"\w* \w like me|strong="H03644"\w*, \w that I can answer Him|strong="H06030"\w*,
\q2 \w that we can take|strong="H03162"\w* \w each other|strong="H00935"\w* \w to court|strong="H04941"\w*.
\q1 \v 33 \w Nor|strong="H03808"\w* \w is there|strong="H03426"\w* \w a mediator|strong="H03198"\w* \w between us|strong="H00996"\w*,
\q2 \w to lay|strong="H07896"\w* \w his hand|strong="H03027"\w* \w upon us|strong="H05921"\w* \w both|strong="H08147"\w*.
\q1 \v 34 \w Let Him remove|strong="H05493"\w* \w His rod|strong="H07626"\w* \w from me|strong="H05921"\w*,
\q2 \w so that His terror|strong="H00367"\w* \w will no|strong="H00408"\w* \w longer frighten me|strong="H01204"\w*.
\q1 \v 35 \w Then I would speak|strong="H01696"\w* \w without|strong="H03808"\w* \w fear of Him|strong="H03372"\w*.
\q2 \w But|strong="H03588"\w* \w as it is|strong="H03808"\w*, \w I|strong="H00595"\w* \w am on my own|strong="H05978"\w*.[’’]
\c 10
\s1 Job’s Plea to God
\q1 \v 1 “\w I loathe|strong="H05354"\w* \w my own|strong="H05315"\w* \w life|strong="H02416"\w*;
\q2 \w I will express|strong="H05800"\w* \w my complaint|strong="H07879"\w*
\q2 \w and speak|strong="H01696"\w* \w in the bitterness|strong="H04751"\w* \w of my soul|strong="H05315"\w*.
\q1 \v 2 \w I will say|strong="H00559"\w* \w to|strong="H00413"\w* \w God|strong="H00433"\w*:
\q2 \w Do not|strong="H00408"\w* \w condemn me|strong="H07561"\w*!
\q2 \w Let me know|strong="H03045"\w* \w why|strong="H05921"\w* \w You prosecute me|strong="H07378"\w*.
\q1 \v 3 \w Does it please|strong="H02896"\w* You \w to oppress me|strong="H06231"\w*,
\q2 \w to reject|strong="H03988"\w* \w the work|strong="H03018"\w* \w of Your hands|strong="H03709"\w*
\q2 \w and favor|strong="H03313"\w* \w the schemes|strong="H06098"\w* \w of the wicked|strong="H07563"\w*?
\q1 \v 4 \w Do You have eyes|strong="H05869"\w* \w of flesh|strong="H01320"\w*?
\q2 \w Do You see|strong="H07200"\w* \w as man|strong="H00582"\w* \w sees|strong="H07200"\w*?
\q1 \v 5 \w Are Your days|strong="H03117"\w* \w like those|strong="H03117"\w* \w of a mortal|strong="H00582"\w*,
\q2 \w or|strong="H00518"\w* \w Your years|strong="H08141"\w* \w like those|strong="H03117"\w* \w of a man|strong="H01397"\w*,
\q1 \v 6 \w that|strong="H03588"\w* \w You should seek|strong="H01245"\w* \w my iniquity|strong="H05771"\w*
\q2 \w and search out|strong="H01875"\w* \w my sin|strong="H02403"\w* —
\q1 \v 7 \w though|strong="H05921"\w* \w You know|strong="H01847"\w* \w that|strong="H03588"\w* \w I am not|strong="H03808"\w* \w guilty|strong="H07561"\w*,
\q2 \w and there is no|strong="H00369"\w* \w deliverance|strong="H05337"\w* \w from Your hand|strong="H03027"\w*?
\b 
\q1 \v 8 \w Your hands|strong="H03027"\w* \w shaped me|strong="H06087"\w* \w and altogether|strong="H03162"\w* \w formed me|strong="H06213"\w*.
\q2 \w Would You now turn|strong="H05439"\w* \w and destroy me|strong="H01104"\w*?
\q1 \v 9 \w Please|strong="H04994"\w* \w remember|strong="H02142"\w* \w that|strong="H03588"\w* \w You molded me|strong="H06213"\w* \w like clay|strong="H02563"\w*.
\q2 \w Would You now return me|strong="H07725"\w* \w to|strong="H00413"\w* \w dust|strong="H06083"\w*?
\q1 \v 10 \w Did You not|strong="H03808"\w* \w pour me out|strong="H05413"\w* \w like milk|strong="H02461"\w*,
\q2 \w and curdle me|strong="H07087"\w* \w like cheese|strong="H01385"\w*?
\q1 \v 11 \w You clothed me|strong="H03847"\w* \w with skin|strong="H05785"\w* \w and flesh|strong="H01320"\w*,
\q2 \w and knit me together|strong="H05526"\w* \w with bones|strong="H06106"\w* \w and sinews|strong="H01517"\w*.
\q1 \v 12 \w You have granted|strong="H06213"\w* \w me|strong="H05978"\w* \w life|strong="H02416"\w* \w and loving devotion|strong="H02617"\w*,\f + \fr 10:12 \ft Forms of the Hebrew \fqa chesed \ft are translated here and in most cases throughout the Scriptures as \fqa loving devotion\ft ; the range of meaning includes \fqa love\ft , \fqa goodness\ft , \fqa kindness\ft , \fqa faithfulness\ft , and \fqa mercy\ft , as well as \fqa loyalty to a covenant\ft .\f*
\q2 \w and Your care|strong="H06486"\w* \w has preserved|strong="H08104"\w* \w my spirit|strong="H07307"\w*.
\b 
\q1 \v 13 \w Yet You concealed|strong="H06845"\w* \w these things|strong="H00428"\w* \w in Your heart|strong="H03824"\w*,
\q2 \w and I know|strong="H03045"\w* \w that|strong="H03588"\w* \w this was|strong="H02063"\w* \w in Your mind|strong="H05973"\w*:
\q1 \v 14 \w If|strong="H00518"\w* \w I sinned|strong="H02398"\w*, \w You would take note|strong="H08104"\w*,
\q2 \w and would not|strong="H03808"\w* \w acquit me|strong="H05352"\w* \w of my iniquity|strong="H05771"\w*.
\q1 \v 15 \w If|strong="H00518"\w* \w I am guilty|strong="H07561"\w*, \w woe|strong="H00480"\w* to me!
\q2 \w And even if I am righteous|strong="H06663"\w*, \w I cannot|strong="H03808"\w* \w lift|strong="H05375"\w* \w my head|strong="H07218"\w*.
\q1 \w I am full|strong="H07649"\w* \w of shame|strong="H07036"\w*
\q2 \w and aware of|strong="H07202"\w* \w my affliction|strong="H06040"\w*.
\q1 \v 16 \w Should I hold my head high|strong="H01342"\w*,
\q2 \w You would hunt me|strong="H06679"\w* \w like a lion|strong="H07826"\w*,
\q2 \w and again|strong="H07725"\w* \w display Your power|strong="H06381"\w* against me.
\q1 \v 17 \w You produce new|strong="H02318"\w* \w witnesses|strong="H05707"\w* \w against me|strong="H05048"\w*
\q2 \w and multiply|strong="H07235"\w* \w Your anger|strong="H03708"\w* \w toward me|strong="H05978"\w*.
\q1 \w Hardships|strong="H06635"\w* \w assault me|strong="H05973"\w*
\q2 \w in wave after wave|strong="H02487"\w*.
\b 
\q1 \v 18 \w Why then|strong="H04100"\w* \w did You bring me|strong="H03318"\w* \w from the womb|strong="H07358"\w*?
\q2 \w Oh, that I had died|strong="H01478"\w*, \w and no|strong="H03808"\w* \w eye|strong="H05869"\w* \w had seen me|strong="H07200"\w*!
\q1 \v 19 \w If only|strong="H00834"\w* \w I had never|strong="H03808"\w* \w come|strong="H01961"\w* \w to be|strong="H01961"\w*,
\q2 \w but had been carried|strong="H02986"\w* \w from the womb|strong="H00990"\w* \w to the grave|strong="H06913"\w*.
\q1 \v 20 \w Are my days|strong="H03117"\w* \w not|strong="H03808"\w* \w few|strong="H04592"\w*?
\q2 \w Withdraw|strong="H02308"\w* \w from me|strong="H04480"\w*, \w that I may have a little comfort|strong="H01082"\w*,
\q1 \v 21 \w before|strong="H02962"\w* \w I go|strong="H01980"\w* — \w never|strong="H03808"\w* \w to return|strong="H07725"\w* —
\q2 \w to|strong="H00413"\w* \w a land|strong="H00776"\w* \w of darkness|strong="H02822"\w* \w and gloom|strong="H06757"\w*,
\q1 \v 22 \w to a land|strong="H00776"\w* \w of utter darkness|strong="H05890"\w*,
\q2 \w of deep shadow|strong="H06757"\w* \w and disorder|strong="H03808"\w*,
\q2 \w where even the light|strong="H03313"\w* \w is like|strong="H03644"\w* \w darkness|strong="H00652"\w*.”
\c 11
\s1 Zophar Rebukes Job
\p \v 1 \w Then Zophar|strong="H06691"\w* \w the Naamathite|strong="H05284"\w* \w replied|strong="H06030"\w*:
\b 
\q1 \v 2 “\w Should this stream|strong="H07230"\w* \w of words|strong="H01697"\w* \w go unanswered|strong="H03808"\w*
\q2 \w and such|strong="H00518"\w* \w a speaker|strong="H00376"\w* \w be vindicated|strong="H06663"\w*?
\q1 \v 3 \w Should your babbling|strong="H00907"\w* \w put others|strong="H04962"\w* \w to silence|strong="H02790"\w*?
\q2 \w Will you scoff|strong="H03932"\w* \w without|strong="H00369"\w* \w rebuke|strong="H03637"\w*?
\q1 \v 4 \w You have said|strong="H00559"\w*, ‘\w My doctrine is|strong="H03948"\w* \w sound|strong="H02134"\w*,
\q2 \w and I am|strong="H01961"\w* \w pure|strong="H01249"\w* \w in Your sight|strong="H05869"\w*.’
\q1 \v 5 \w But|strong="H00199"\w* \w if only|strong="H04310"\w* \w God|strong="H00433"\w* \w would speak|strong="H01696"\w*
\q2 \w and open|strong="H06605"\w* \w His lips|strong="H08193"\w* \w against you|strong="H05973"\w*,
\q1 \v 6 \w and disclose|strong="H05046"\w* to you \w the secrets|strong="H08587"\w* \w of wisdom|strong="H02451"\w*,
\q2 \w for|strong="H03588"\w* \w true wisdom|strong="H08454"\w* \w has two sides|strong="H03718"\w*.
\q1 \w Know|strong="H03045"\w* \w then that|strong="H03588"\w* \w God|strong="H00433"\w* \w exacts|strong="H05382"\w* from you
\q2 \w less than your iniquity deserves|strong="H05771"\w*.
\b 
\q1 \v 7 \w Can you fathom|strong="H04672"\w* \w the deep things|strong="H02714"\w* \w of God|strong="H00433"\w*
\q2 \w or|strong="H00518"\w* \w discover|strong="H04672"\w* \w the limits|strong="H08503"\w* \w of the Almighty|strong="H07706"\w*?
\q1 \v 8 \w They are higher|strong="H01363"\w* \w than the heavens|strong="H08064"\w*— \w what|strong="H04100"\w* \w can you do|strong="H06466"\w*?
\q2 \w They are deeper|strong="H06013"\w* \w than Sheol|strong="H07585"\w*— \w what|strong="H04100"\w* \w can you know|strong="H03045"\w*?
\q1 \v 9 \w Their measure|strong="H04055"\w* \w is longer|strong="H00752"\w* \w than|strong="H04480"\w* \w the earth|strong="H00776"\w*
\q2 \w and wider|strong="H07342"\w* \w than the sea|strong="H03220"\w*.
\b 
\q1 \v 10 \w If|strong="H00518"\w* \w He comes along|strong="H02498"\w* \w to imprison you|strong="H05462"\w*,
\q2 \w or convenes a court|strong="H06950"\w*, \w who|strong="H04310"\w* \w can stop Him|strong="H07725"\w*?
\q1 \v 11 \w Surely|strong="H03588"\w* \w He|strong="H01931"\w* \w knows|strong="H03045"\w* \w the deceit|strong="H07723"\w* \w of men|strong="H04962"\w*.
\q2 \w If He sees|strong="H07200"\w* \w iniquity|strong="H00205"\w*, \w does He not|strong="H03808"\w* \w take note|strong="H00995"\w*?
\q1 \v 12 \w But a witless|strong="H05014"\w* \w man|strong="H00376"\w* \w can no more become wise|strong="H03823"\w*
\q2 \w than the colt|strong="H05895"\w* \w of a wild donkey|strong="H06501"\w* \w can be born|strong="H03205"\w* \w a man|strong="H00120"\w*!\f + \fr 11:12 \ft Or \fqa can be born tame\f*
\b 
\q1 \v 13 \w As for you|strong="H00859"\w*, \w if|strong="H00518"\w* \w you direct|strong="H03559"\w* \w your heart|strong="H03820"\w*
\q2 \w and lift up|strong="H06566"\w* \w your hands|strong="H03709"\w* \w to Him|strong="H00413"\w*,
\q1 \v 14 \w if|strong="H00518"\w* \w you put away|strong="H07368"\w* \w the iniquity|strong="H00205"\w* \w in your hand|strong="H03027"\w*,
\q2 \w and allow no|strong="H00408"\w* \w injustice|strong="H05766"\w* \w to dwell|strong="H07931"\w* \w in your tents|strong="H00168"\w*,
\q1 \v 15 \w then|strong="H00227"\w* \w indeed|strong="H03588"\w* \w you will lift up|strong="H05375"\w* \w your face|strong="H06440"\w* \w without blemish|strong="H03971"\w*;
\q2 \w you will|strong="H01961"\w* \w stand firm|strong="H03332"\w* \w and unafraid|strong="H03808"\w*.
\q1 \v 16 \w For|strong="H03588"\w* \w you|strong="H00859"\w* \w will forget|strong="H07911"\w* \w your misery|strong="H05999"\w*,
\q2 \w recalling|strong="H02142"\w* \w it only as waters|strong="H04325"\w* \w gone by|strong="H05674"\w*.
\q1 \v 17 \w Your life|strong="H02465"\w* \w will be brighter|strong="H06965"\w* \w than noonday|strong="H06672"\w*;
\q2 \w its darkness|strong="H05774"\w* \w will be|strong="H01961"\w* \w like the morning|strong="H01242"\w*.
\q1 \v 18 \w You will be secure|strong="H00982"\w*, \w because|strong="H03588"\w* \w there is|strong="H03426"\w* \w hope|strong="H08615"\w*,
\q2 \w and you will look around|strong="H02658"\w* \w and lie down|strong="H07901"\w* \w in safety|strong="H00983"\w*.
\b 
\q1 \v 19 \w You will lie down|strong="H07257"\w* \w without|strong="H00369"\w* \w fear|strong="H02729"\w*,
\q2 \w and many|strong="H07227"\w* \w will court|strong="H02470"\w* \w your favor|strong="H06440"\w*.
\q1 \v 20 \w But the eyes|strong="H05869"\w* \w of the wicked|strong="H07563"\w* \w will fail|strong="H03615"\w*,
\q2 \w and escape|strong="H04498"\w* \w will elude them|strong="H00006"\w*;
\q2 \w they will hope|strong="H08615"\w* \w for their last breath|strong="H04646"\w*.”
\c 12
\s1 Job Presents His Case
\p \v 1 \w Then Job|strong="H00347"\w* \w answered|strong="H06030"\w*:
\b 
\q1 \v 2 “\w Truly|strong="H00551"\w* \w then|strong="H03588"\w* \w you|strong="H00859"\w* \w are the people|strong="H05971"\w*
\q2 \w with whom|strong="H05973"\w* \w wisdom itself|strong="H02451"\w* \w will die|strong="H04191"\w*!
\q1 \v 3 \w But I also|strong="H01571"\w* have \w a mind|strong="H03824"\w*;
\q2 \w I|strong="H00595"\w* \w am not|strong="H03808"\w* \w inferior|strong="H05307"\w* to you.
\q2 \w Who|strong="H04310"\w* \w does not know|strong="H00369"\w* \w such things|strong="H03644"\w* \w as these|strong="H00428"\w*?
\b 
\q1 \v 4 \w I am|strong="H01961"\w* \w a laughingstock|strong="H07814"\w* \w to my friends|strong="H07453"\w*,
\q2 \w though I called|strong="H07121"\w* \w on God|strong="H00433"\w*, \w and He answered|strong="H06030"\w*.
\q2 \w The righteous|strong="H06662"\w* \w and upright man|strong="H08549"\w* \w is a laughingstock|strong="H07814"\w*.
\q1 \v 5 \w The one at ease|strong="H07600"\w* \w scorns|strong="H00937"\w* \w misfortune|strong="H06365"\w*
\q2 \w as the fate|strong="H06248"\w* \w of those whose feet|strong="H07272"\w* \w are slipping|strong="H04571"\w*.
\q1 \v 6 \w The tents|strong="H00168"\w* \w of robbers|strong="H07703"\w* \w are safe|strong="H07951"\w*,
\q2 \w and those who provoke|strong="H07264"\w* \w God|strong="H00410"\w* \w are secure|strong="H00987"\w* —
\q2 \w those who carry|strong="H00935"\w* \w their god|strong="H00433"\w* \w in their hands|strong="H03027"\w*.\f + \fr 12:6 \ft Or \fqa though God keeps them in His power\f*
\b 
