\q2 \w and mourns|strong="H00056"\w* \w only for|strong="H05921"\w* \w himself|strong="H05315"\w*.”
\c 15
\s1 Eliphaz: Job Does Not Fear God
\p \v 1 \w Then Eliphaz|strong="H00464"\w* \w the Temanite|strong="H08489"\w* \w replied|strong="H06030"\w*:
\b 
\q1 \v 2 “\w Does a wise|strong="H02450"\w* \w man answer|strong="H06030"\w* \w with empty|strong="H07307"\w* \w counsel|strong="H01847"\w*
