\q2 \w twice|strong="H08147"\w*, \w but I have nothing|strong="H03808"\w* \w to add|strong="H03254"\w*.”
\s1 The LORD Challenges Job Again
\p \v 6 \w Then the LORD|strong="H03068"\w* \w answered|strong="H06030"\w* \w Job|strong="H00347"\w* \w out of|strong="H04480"\w* \w the whirlwind|strong="H05591"\w* \w and said|strong="H00559"\w*:
\b 
\q1 \v 7 “\w Now|strong="H04994"\w* \w brace|strong="H00247"\w* \w yourself|strong="H02504"\w*\f + \fr 40:7 \ft Hebrew \fqa gird up your loins\f* \w like a man|strong="H01397"\w*;
\q2 \w I will question you|strong="H07592"\w*, \w and you shall inform Me|strong="H03045"\w*.\f + \fr 40:7 \ft Cited in Job 42:4\f*
\b 
