\q2 \w imprison them|strong="H02280"\w* \w in the grave|strong="H02934"\w*.\f + \fr 40:13 \ft Or \fqa in the hidden place\f*
\q1 \v 14 \w Then|strong="H01571"\w* \w I|strong="H00589"\w* \w will confess to you|strong="H03034"\w*
